msgid ""
"All running threads of the process are interrupted and eventually active "
"critical sections are aborted before these threads return to user space. The "
"ID fields are only updated if changed as a consequence of the interrupt. All "
"threads which are scheduled out whether voluntary or not are covered by #1/"
"#2 above."
msgstr ""

